                                     "text": "Here's the result of running `cat -n` on                                                                                           
                             /home/pst/Documents/vhl/vhl_ana/virtual_hardware_laboratary/ana/resources/component_pin_mapping.md:\n     1\t# Component Pin Mapping\n              
                             2\t\n     3\t## A_150060GS75000\n     4\tpin1: K\n     5\tpin2: A\n     6\t\n     7\t## BQ79616PAPR\n     8\tpin1: BAT\n     9\tpin2:               
