                             GPIO3 -> Pin 6: GPIO3_R\\n        *   ...\\n        *   Pin 15: GPIO8 -> Pin              
                             16: GPIO8_R\\n    *   Wait, 8 channels * 2 pins = 16 pins. Correct.\\n\\n*                
