                             GND\\n\\n**U1 Connections:**\\n*   U1.BAT -> R5.pin1\\n*   R5.pin2 -> PWR\\n*             
                             C5.pin1 -> U1.BAT\\n*   C5.pin2 -> GND\\n*   U1.NPNB -> net.NPNB\\n\\nI will              
                             add these connections. I will also add the LED D1.\\n\\n**LED D1:**\\n*                   
                             Green LED D1 with R121 (1.0k) and Jumper J6.\\n*   SCUD: \\\"Indicator: Green             
                             LED D1 with R121 (1.0k) and Jumper J6 (Power Indicator).\\\"\\n*   Usually:               
                             PWR -> J6 -> R121 -> D1 -> GND.\\n*   Or: PWR -> R121 -> D1 -> J6 -> GND.\\n*             
                             Let's assume standard: PWR -> J6 -> R121 -> D1 -> GND.\\n*   I need to                    
                             declare J6, R121, D1.\\n\\nI'll update the file.\"}",                                     
